                "position_z": 0,
                "properties": {},
                "save_in_preset": false,
                "scope": "__patch__",
                "style": {},
                "update_required": true,
                "value": "Note especially the -v option, which copies all log messages to the console.  \nThis may be helpful if a problem is causing MFP to crash and take log messages \nwith it.  Usually, after startup all log messages will go to the \"Log\" tab below, but \nwill not be printed to stdout.",
                "width": 549.0
            },
            "initargs": null,
            "midi_filters": null,
            "midi_mode": null,
            "name": "text_021",
            "osc_methods": [],
            "presets": {},
            "properties": {},
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Note especially the -v option, which copies all log messages to the console.  \nThis may be helpful if a problem is causing MFP to crash and take log messages \nwith it.  Usually, after startup all log messages will go to the \"Log\" tab below, but \nwill not be printed to stdout."
        },
