                "style": {},
                "update_required": true,
                "value": "<b>C-s</b> saves the current patch.  A prompt for a filename will appear in the command line area at the bottom of the window. You can type in a file name (defaulting to the process working directory) or click the \"Select...\" button to use your system file chooser.",
