                "position_z": 0,
                "properties": {},
                "save_in_preset": false,
                "scope": "__patch__",
                "style": {},
                "update_required": true,
                "value": "<b>C-o</b> opens a previously-saved patch.  A prompt for a filename will appear in the command line area. The file will be searched for on the <i>patch path</i>, which is: the process working directory or session data directory, plus any directories specified with the <b>-p</b> option at startup time, plus the system patch paths under /share/mfp/patches in the install tree (either system or virtualenv).\n\nAll of these file operations are available under the File menu, with reminders of their keyboard shortcuts. ",
                "width": 580.0
            },
            "initargs": null,
            "midi_filters": null,
            "midi_mode": null,
            "name": "text_024",
            "osc_methods": [],
            "presets": {},
            "properties": {},
            "type": "text",
            "value": "<b>C-o</b> opens a previously-saved patch.  A prompt for a filename will appear in the command line area. The file will be searched for on the <i>patch path</i>, which is: the process working directory or session data directory, plus any directories specified with the <b>-p</b> option at startup time, plus the system patch paths under /share/mfp/patches in the install tree (either system or virtualenv).\n\nAll of these file operations are available under the File menu, with reminders of their keyboard shortcuts. "
        },
