                "position_z": 0,
                "properties": {},
                "save_in_preset": false,
                "scope": "__patch__",
                "style": {},
                "update_required": true,
                "value": "> [!TIP]\n> Type the following in your working patch to create a \"Hello, world\" patch:\n\n| **You type** | **Action taken** |\n|-|-|\n| m | Create a message element |\n| \"hello, world\" RET | Enter message data |\n| c | Enter connection mode |\n| a | Show Autoplace marker | \n| p | Create a Processor element | \n| print RET | Make it a print element |\n| RET | Accept the proposed connection |\n",
                "width": 468.0
            },
            "initargs": null,
            "midi_filters": null,
            "midi_mode": null,
            "name": "text_033",
            "osc_methods": [],
            "presets": {},
            "properties": {},
            "type": "text",
            "value": "> [!TIP]\n> Type the following in your working patch to create a \"Hello, world\" patch:\n\n| **You type** | **Action taken** |\n|-|-|\n| m | Create a message element |\n| \"hello, world\" RET | Enter message data |\n| c | Enter connection mode |\n| a | Show Autoplace marker | \n| p | Create a Processor element | \n| print RET | Make it a print element |\n| RET | Accept the proposed connection |\n"
        },
