            "value": ">[!TIP]\n> Hit <b>ESC</b> to enter <b>Operate</b> mode, then click on the message box\n\nObserve that the message \"hello, world\" appears in the log tab below. \n\nIf you don't want to use the mouse, <b>TAB</b> until the message box is selected, and then <b>RET</b> to trigger it."
