                "update_required": true,
                "value": "Messages coming into a processor only trigger the processor if the inlet is \"hot\". Usually, only the leftmost inlet is \"hot\".  To marshal a set of inputs (arguments) to the processor, send to all the other inlets first, then to the leftmost inlet.",
