                "scope": "__patch__",
                "style": {},
                "update_required": true,
                "value": "The <b>[case]</b> and <b>[route]</b> objects are the building blocks of \nconditional code.  <b>[case]</b> tests its left inlet for equality against a \nseries of values and repeats the input value on the corresponding positional \noutput.   If no test matches, the value is repeated on the rightmost outlet. ",
                "width": 528.0
            },
            "initargs": null,
            "midi_filters": null,
            "midi_mode": null,
            "name": "text_054",
            "osc_methods": [],
            "presets": {},
            "properties": {},
            "type": "text",
            "value": "The <b>[case]</b> and <b>[route]</b> objects are the building blocks of \nconditional code.  <b>[case]</b> tests its left inlet for equality against a \nseries of values and repeats the input value on the corresponding positional \noutput.   If no test matches, the value is repeated on the rightmost outlet. "
        },
