            "type": "text",
            "value": "One last important thing: in both <b>[route]</b> and <b>[case]</b>, if the objects \nto test against are Python <i>type</i> objects, any object of the indicated type \nwill match.  Tests are done in left-to-right order with the first successful match\naccepted.  "
        },
